<description>&lt;p&gt;Jihadist militants have intensified attacks in Niger state, killing dozens of civilians, 11 soldiers in the southeast, at least 16 soldiers near the Malian border, and 25 soldiers in another strike, while Fulani communities suffered mass killings of at least 64 people. In Mali, Russian forces have suffered heavy losses, with reports of more than 300 Russian soldiers dead as Moscow supports the military junta. A Russian envoy claims Ukrainian officers are training Sahel armed groups on drones, linking external actors to the insurgency. The Sahel jihadist insurgency caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxObXRFZnVnX3cybUp2cXhyN0dTY09vOFo1RTVnQ3hVOVFJeG9IbHd3Slh2NUhfNm55NlFXeWRPM2E5aFB4ci1RTVhpbGRtNldGUF9XdjJoemFSUjB2ZWlmSXhEQ3NJRHh3ZE1wNURTRGZvTE1aMTRBRmZMQ1g5X1YweVdUdXVmbVBNN1VjMFVWaVJpdjlzdEI2R3dXdTByckxkZDBtd0dFcXl2djZKYnhiOENjVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxPaW5vTkNwY0ZySGFvOXRVbGFNenRIOWxEWk4tU19XejFVdDlHNWlSV0lYTFotS0plWG9RREM5ZmhaRHFwYzFseWNiR0kwOThyWVZDNGNzdGx4YkxVanJhRTI0MHNHUTNYX05WcFNoYURlODhBMk5NbTcxQm9hN3ZkU2RQWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;EWN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxQXzZrVXI3bllTSndtazIzeU45b0M5N3pKc1ZJdXBPS3F0VDZjY1N3eXhtM0lWTy1aUk5VeUpQbE56QWUxTUI1MW8zUFkxLTYyNl9UcXJHaWs5TFRzSWR6SDhjLTVwT0FPUnFGTEltWF96THVaSDl6VTdmSmhoUjRsSFRoUk9ZbHEzN3dmZU1fb1hDSXYxazh0TXVoZ1NzOUlhR0x3Q19YYU1ISk9ZMmJ3VllIWktPWmYybUMxQW10WkRuM2hIV0xuQzN3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Diari ARA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQc3I2dGxNLWNjU1U4MDZJTVBsNVlPcURPeklvdUNxQ0Q3LVFYNnZ5cFNqTTZLNk92MFRwZEdzbDk4VVVjb0ZsRnJ1RzMwcVhmZHhvZWZCaDBjSzJ4NHB2T19yMTRGcXRic3BJQUR3OVFnekhVWjBRbktwRWhqV0pGZjVHZDZ